# Frontend

Folders: `pages/`, `features/chat`, `features/config`, `shared/api`, `shared/models`. Do not put React under `src/cctv/`.

## Server as source of truth

Config and conversation state live in FastAPI. After `GET/PUT /api/config` or the `done` event from `POST /api/conversations/{id}/messages/stream`, adopt the returned state. Do not keep a second client-side catalog.

- Config writes only the overlays (`configs/cameras.local.yaml` and `configs/agent.local.yaml` on the server).
- Assistant turns may include `imageUrls` for cited frames. Load images from `/api/images/...`, not base64 in JSON.

## Security and UX (v1)

- No Azure keys or other secrets in the frontend; model calls go through FastAPI.
- One page: chat column left, config panel right.
- Roles: `user` | `assistant`. SSE reports progress and the completed transcript; model tokens are not streamed.

When you change UI behavior or layout, verify the flow in the browser if tools are available.
